WEBVTT

00:12:58.555 --> 00:13:00.286
this is what they were striving for.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:02.778
They weren't trying to make it
in legitimate ways,

00:13:02.802 --> 00:13:04.992
because there were
no legitimate channels out.

00:13:05.016 --> 00:13:06.389
This was the best way out.

00:13:06.413 --> 00:13:09.084
And it actually was
the right choice, probably,

00:13:09.108 --> 00:13:12.434
to try to make it out this way.

00:13:13.117 --> 00:13:14.401
You look at this,

00:13:14.425 --> 00:13:17.344
the relationship to McDonald's
breaks down here.

00:13:17.368 --> 00:13:19.303
The money looks about the same.

00:13:19.327 --> 00:13:20.769
Why is it such a bad job?

00:13:20.793 --> 00:13:24.509
Well, the reason it's such a bad job
is that there's somebody shooting at you

00:13:24.533 --> 00:13:26.095
a lot of the time.

00:13:26.119 --> 00:13:28.976
So, with shooting at you,
what are the death rates?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.157
We found, in our gang --